{"id":"7756fbdad1fb","pages":[{"n":1,"words":7,"heads":[{"t":"Owner\u2019s Manual","lvl":1}],"blocks":[{"k":"p","t":"Yor vad Horry"},{"k":"h","t":"Owner\u2019s Manual"},{"k":"p","t":"SEGA / Gremlin = 430-0613"}]},{"n":2,"words":24,"blocks":[{"k":"p","t":"Perecoleeliua os: Dd ee"},{"k":"p","t":"OPERATING INSTRUCTIONS"},{"k":"p","t":"AND"},{"k":"p","t":"SERVICE MANUAL"},{"k":"p","t":"MANUFACTURED BY"},{"k":"p","t":"SEGA/GREMLIN TLX 910-335-1621"},{"k":"p","t":"BORDERLINE OWNER'S MANUAL Copyright - 1981 by SEGA/Gremlin, All Rights Reserved"}]},{"n":3,"words":77,"blocks":[{"k":"p","t":"INTRODUCTION"},{"k":"p","t":"BORDERLINE ts an electronic game that makes extensive use of digital"},{"k":"p","t":"Integrated circuitry and television monitor concepts. This manual Is"},{"k":"p","t":"designed for the maintenance technician who possesses a general knowledge"},{"k":"p","t":"of solid state circuitry, microprocessor and digital Integrated circuitry and TV monitor concepts. Any Individual not knowledgeable in these areas"},{"k":"p","t":"should not attempt repair of the electronic portion of the game. If you"},{"k":"p","t":"have any questions not answered in this manual, call SEGA/Gremlin Customer"},{"k":"p","t":"Service, 800-854-1098."}]},{"n":4,"words":257,"heads":[{"t":"components or connectors have come loose. Proper connector fittings must","lvl":1}],"blocks":[{"k":"p","t":"GAME SET-UP AND INSPECTION"},{"k":"li","t":"1. Inspection Before pluggging In your new game, inspect it closely to spot any possible shipping damage. Check to ensure the graphics are in place, the"},{"k":"p","t":"monitor Is not damaged and that the overall cabinet is in good condition."},{"k":"p","t":"Open the rear access panel and inspect the inside of the game. Be sure no"},{"k":"h","t":"components or connectors have come loose. Proper connector fittings must"},{"k":"p","t":"be checked before game power is applied. Check all related connectors for"},{"k":"p","t":"good contact. Although disconnected are easily spotted, poor contacts are"},{"k":"p","t":"difficult to locate. The connectors should therefore be pushed in firmly and then loosened to spot poor connections. Check to ensure the fuses are"},{"k":"p","t":"intact. There are three fuses (not counting the monitor fuses). They are"},{"k":"p","t":"located on the power supply."},{"k":"li","t":"2. Important Notes The following note is included in compliance with FCC rules:"},{"k":"note","t":"WARNING: This equipment generates, uses, and can radiate radio frequenc"},{"k":"p","t":"energy and if not installed and used in accordance with the instruction"},{"k":"p","t":"manual, may cause interference to radio communications. As temporarily"},{"k":"p","t":"permitted by regulations, it has not been tested for compliance with the"},{"k":"p","t":"limits for Class A computing devices pursuant to Subpart J of Part 15 FCC"},{"k":"p","t":"Rules, which are designed to provide reasonable protection against"},{"k":"p","t":"interference in which case the user at his own expense will be required"},{"k":"p","t":"to take whatever measures may be required to correct the interference."},{"k":"li","t":"3. Miscellaneous"},{"k":"p","t":"NEVER remove circuit board connections while the power is on."},{"k":"p","t":"NEVER replace any components with anything other than exact replacement"},{"k":"p","t":"parts."}]},{"n":5,"words":58,"blocks":[{"k":"p","t":"DO NOT replace fuses with anything other than proper value. A blown fuse"},{"k":"p","t":"Indicates an overload condition within the game. Replacing the fuse"},{"k":"p","t":"with a higher value can cause damage to Internal components, if an"},{"k":"p","t":"overload occurs."},{"k":"p","t":"CORRESPONDENCE regarding this game should be addressed to:"},{"k":"p","t":"SEGA/Gremlin 8401 Aero Drive San Diego, California 92123 Attn: Customer Service (800) 854-1098"}]},{"n":6,"words":259,"blocks":[{"k":"p","t":"GAME CONCEPT"},{"k":"p","t":"BORDERLINE is a one or two player game In which players attempt to"},{"k":"p","t":"destroy enemy refineries and energy plants. The player moves through four"},{"k":"p","t":"different sectors, constantly under attack by enemy tanks, missles, interceptors"},{"k":"p","t":"and drones."},{"k":"p","t":"Sector 1"},{"k":"p","t":"The player is deep behind enemy lines, rolling his jeep down a corridor."},{"k":"p","t":"He must dodge fire from interceptors, tanks and missles. Drones will attack"},{"k":"p","t":"unexpectedly. The object is to reach and destroy the energy plants at the"},{"k":"p","t":"end of the corridor."},{"k":"p","t":"Sector 2"},{"k":"p","t":"Once through the corridor, the player enters a field that contains two"},{"k":"p","t":"sections of dense underbrush patrolled by drones. The drones will only enter"},{"k":"p","t":"the underbrush in one place, then follow in the path the player's jeep makes."},{"k":"p","t":"The player must make a maze through the underbrush and proceed to the top"},{"k":"p","t":"and destroy the energy plants."},{"k":"p","t":"Sector 3"},{"k":"p","t":"In this sector, enemy tanks come down from the top, near the refineries,"},{"k":"p","t":"and drones enter from the side. The player must outmanuever the enemy and"},{"k":"p","t":"destroy the refineries at the top."},{"k":"p","t":"Sector 4"},{"k":"p","t":"Again, there are two sections of underbrush, this time separated by walls."},{"k":"p","t":"Drones enter from the sides. They will break the wall once, but not twice and"},{"k":"p","t":"will follow in the path made by the player's jeep. In the upper section of"},{"k":"p","t":"underbrush, is the energy plant. This time protected by revolving armament,"},{"k":"p","t":"in addition to tanks. The object is to destroy the energy base. Players"},{"k":"p","t":"alternate at the destruction of each jeep. The game ends when all jeeps are"},{"k":"p","t":"destroyed. 5"}]},{"n":7,"words":96,"heads":[{"t":"Bonus Jeep at 15,000 Points x off xX x x x","lvl":1}],"blocks":[{"k":"p","t":"BORDERLINE OPTIONS SELECTION"},{"k":"p","